"person-display formatting (fuzzy_match_display.py), and a standalone lookup "
"window (FuzzyMatchLookupWindow.py) for a quick 'does someone like this "
"already exist' check from another plugin. See FuzzyMatchAPI.md in this "
"addon's own folder for the calling convention."
